From: Robert Marko <robimarko@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 16:11:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: connect IPQ6018 secure WCSS and WLAN

Describe secure WCSS firmware, clocks and the IPQ6018 AHB radio in the SoC tree. Keep the SMP2P acknowledgement protocol in its own unit.

Split from:
  0905-soc-qcom-ipq6018-wcss-bringup.patch - soc: qcom: connect IPQ6018 secure WCSS and SMP2P acknowledgments

Previous merged from (0905-soc-qcom-ipq6018-wcss-bringup.patch):
  0905-arm64-dts-qcom-ipq6018-use-secure-WCSS-remoteproc.patch
  0906-arm64-dts-qcom-ipq6018-add-wifi-node.patch
  0907-soc-qcom-fix-smp2p-ack-on-ipq6018.patch

Original-commit: 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000
Original-commit: 153c74fc80b9f33ed1a50d7790bf6979fdceb370
Original-commit: d93936f175bd914067df8f63f5fbe6e3b77bb4d2

Signed-off-by: Robert Marko <robimarko@gmail.com>
Signed-off-by: Mantas Pucka <mantas@8devices.com>
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq6018.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq6018.dtsi
@@ -870,17 +870,116 @@
 			};
 		};
 
+		wifi: wifi@c000000 {
+			compatible = "qcom,ipq6018-wifi";
+			qcom,ath11k-fw-memory-mode = <1>;
+			reg = <0x0 0xc000000 0x0 0x1000000>;
+			qcom,rproc = <&q6v5_wcss>;
+			interrupts = <GIC_SPI 320 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 319 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 318 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 317 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 316 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 315 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 314 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 311 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 310 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 411 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 410 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 40 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 39 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 302 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
+				     <GIC_SPI 301 IRQ_TYPE_EDGE_RISING>,
